Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.96,0:00:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Narancia, when you get a\Nsec, let me see that key.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Look for the turtle at the water\Nfountain, and use this key.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.86,0:00:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The thankful death!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Just the driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.54,0:00:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone else is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.02,0:00:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like they took the bait!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.72,0:00:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd this frickin'\Nhook get under my skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.58,0:00:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be the guy that's\Ntrying to age us to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.62,0:01:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.02,0:01:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.78,0:01:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.06,0:01:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Temasita, Junior!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting God!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.48,0:02:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.24,0:02:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.06,0:02:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I know Bucciarati and his\Ngoons are on the train, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.08,0:02:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is tugging on my hook?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.86,0:02:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No way it could be that girl Trish!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.60,0:02:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No teenage girl has that much power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.30,0:02:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whoever they are, they're a\Nhuman being that weighs 68 kilograms.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.80,0:02:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to reel this sucker in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.76,0:02:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with this hook?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's getting deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this be the enemy's stand ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.16,0:02:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.40,0:02:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's chewing up my arm\Nlike a damn missile.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.00,0:02:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't break the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.44,0:02:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, looks like I snagged Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.64,0:02:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I definitely felt a bullet hit my line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.42,0:03:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And the asshole with\Nthe gun is Guido Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.66,0:03:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well played, Quick Draw, but\Nmy line is indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.84,0:03:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now where will the reverberation\Nfrom the bullet go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.84,0:03:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's reel you in and give it a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.76,0:03:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotta rip this thing out and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta do something. This thing\Nis gonna furrow into my brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.04,0:03:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.04,0:03:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on, six bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.80,0:03:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull this damn hook out of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.76,0:03:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, he's not here taking us for a ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It has more pulled than the\Nthree of us put together!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.48,0:03:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm on my own here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.56,0:03:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's time for some surgery!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.10,0:03:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.42,0:03:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Count on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.56,0:03:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta track it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Failure is not an option,\Nso keep your eyes peeled!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.26,0:03:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:03:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.82,0:03:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Did Mista fire off his revolver?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you\Neven shooting at, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you trying to take out\None of these poor passengers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I get what you're trying to do, using your\Nbullets to ferret me out like a sniper.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever, you're still screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.12,0:04:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you enjoyed your hearing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.66,0:04:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,because my hook is headed\Nstraight for your inner ear!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.82,0:04:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.73,0:04:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.94,0:04:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta aim closer or else we're never\Ngonna blast the ice out of this room!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.44,0:04:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a little lure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.92,0:04:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.90,0:04:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it moving, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Blast that ice, the King of Khan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.52,0:04:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The primary target is getting ahead now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, ragazzi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.36,0:04:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Shatter it to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:04:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.84,0:05:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course he would be\Ntrying to keep himself cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.82,0:05:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about having a one-trek mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've gone and done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.96,0:05:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Was this guy supposed to\Nbe the Pasty Pineapple?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this weird looking doobard guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.72,0:05:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.72,0:05:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the guy that was\Ncontrolling that freaky hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, that fishing rod looking\Nthing must be his stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.16,0:05:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't get some ice, Fro's age\Naccelerator's gonna kill me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.16,0:05:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you have to help me! Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.94,0:05:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm serious, geyser!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your rotten meds off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.74,0:05:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so heavy, and all I\Nwant to do is take a good nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.64,0:05:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I ordered a big juicy snake, too, and now\NI don't even have the energy to enjoy it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.92,0:05:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the prick away, you freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.02,0:05:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,His hand is toast!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.38,0:05:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me staying here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.34,0:05:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista, you're clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.12,0:06:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mista, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The stand user's ready for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright now, six bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.30,0:06:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for you all to get\Nback to your stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.70,0:06:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have one simple question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.40,0:06:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You can ignore it if you want, but I'm\Nstill going to ask, so just deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.96,0:06:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think there's something\Nyou should know first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.10,0:06:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can't find the words to muster up\Na coherent response within two seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.06,0:06:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to shoot hot\Nlead into those beady
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.10,0:06:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,targets framing that bugly nose of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.86,0:07:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's uno, then due.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, it's bye-bye, pasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.76,0:07:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're clear, I expect an honest answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.64,0:07:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is your\Nlife-stealing companion hiding out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.48,0:07:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.90,0:07:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been here wondering the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.12,0:07:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.32,0:07:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now die, Katsune.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I need your help, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.16,0:07:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, juicy marbled steak\Nused to be my favorite meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you get out of the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be chowing down on your\Nsteak again before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh boy, instead I'll be bringing\Nabout your demise. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.46,0:07:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,End his life, thankful death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.34,0:07:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.25,0:07:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.17,0:07:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're not really an\Nold man at all, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.78,0:07:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a death geyser.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.52,0:08:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Death comes quicker using direct contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.20,0:08:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Once thankful death caresses you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,your body is filled with its\Nsoul-sucking necrotic energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My bullets are dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's happening so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really my big bro\Nunder that saggy skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.56,0:08:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa that's so crazy you\Nhad me completely fooled!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.94,0:08:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You were really something bro\Nman attacking your own body in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.52,0:08:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Order to blend in with the other\Npassengers takes real guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.34,0:08:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It is you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.54,0:08:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I knew it was, but wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.56,0:08:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You never failed to impress, big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.14,0:08:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You absolute waste of space!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.34,0:09:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that\Natrocious display back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,How was I supposed to know the\Nguy was gonna shoot the ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.74,0:09:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There was nothing I\Ncould do, bro, I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.62,0:09:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You still don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.14,0:09:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a goddamn Mamoni!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.24,0:09:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Not in the face, bro! Please! Have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.68,0:09:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Pesci, do you want to\Nknow why I'm pissed off?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.40,0:09:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's because you've been\Ncursed with such a weak spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.18,0:09:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The beanie-wearing bastard blasted\Nyour ice, which threw you for a loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.36,0:09:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.16,0:09:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm also being aged, so this ain't\Na walk in the park for me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.72,0:09:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, no one else from the team\Nwould have stopped their attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.98,0:09:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Calling back your stand\Nat the moment of truth
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.34,0:09:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,with the enemy is the very\Ndefinition of cowardice,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.90,0:09:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.81,0:09:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else would have done so even\Nif they were being dismembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.96,0:09:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So like I said, you're a damn Mamoni.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You practically pissed yourself\Nin that battle with Nista.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.12,0:09:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And it wasn't about the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.96,0:09:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Deep down in your heart of\Nhearts, terror took hold of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to man up now, Pesci.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.16,0:09:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't, glory will be\Nforever beyond our reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.80,0:10:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati and his sidekicks will win.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.96,0:10:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't want that\Nfate, then pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.34,0:10:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not the same as that\Ngang of ass-kissing losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.12,0:10:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't indulge in empty\Nthreats or self-coddling
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,compliments to hide our\Nfeeble shortcomings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.88,0:10:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Our breed doesn't need\Nthe aid of such low-brow
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,extravagances to enhance\Nour battle performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.42,0:10:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,For the moment, we visualize\Nthe death of our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.22,0:10:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Their fate is sealed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They cannot escape the inevitable!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, let's be off,\NPesci, and have some ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.70,0:10:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I recall you saying there was another\Nsoul hiding out in the driver's car,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.76,0:10:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,so let's hurry out there\Nand finish this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.24,0:10:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind\Nof trick they're using,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but if that little harlot\Nis there, I'll find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.40,0:11:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't worry about Narancia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.50,0:11:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That ice is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.22,0:11:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who must survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.54,0:11:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry about your body temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.06,0:11:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to take a lot more than a fan\Nand a damp towel to cool Narancia off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.34,0:11:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing that's going\Nto help him now is this ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.20,0:11:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,At the rate he's aging,\Nhe'll be the first to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.62,0:11:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We're members of the Mafia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.60,0:11:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We knew the dangers when\Nwe accepted this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Know that your well-being\Noutweighs any of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.68,0:11:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Guarding you is our duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.98,0:11:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Needless to say, you brought\Nnone of this on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.38,0:11:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.86,0:11:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The culprit behind this attack will\Nmeet their end by Meesta's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.42,0:11:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll find a way to pull through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:11:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:11:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.66,0:12:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They have to be in this car somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.36,0:12:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How are they hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.68,0:12:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.84,0:12:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The key is to start thinking about\Nthe world in four dimensions.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,At the binario, Bucciarati picked up\Na certain something sent by the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.26,0:12:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.17,0:12:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If I find that object,\NI'll find our quarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.24,0:12:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pesci.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.04,0:12:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You felt another presence\Nin this car, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.74,0:12:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you given any thought\Nto what it might have been?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.76,0:12:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you still sense it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you everything I know, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.28,0:12:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.54,0:12:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish you wouldn't put so much\Npressure on me all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have the wits that you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.56,0:12:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Pesci, Pesci, Pesci, Pesci untrue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.38,0:13:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I have unwavering faith in your ability,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.90,0:13:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,which is the reason I got\Nso angry with you earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.88,0:13:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You need self-confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.84,0:13:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can snap out of this\Nfunk and come into your own,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.10,0:13:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you'll be the unbeatable\Nforce of nature you were meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.66,0:13:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.94,0:13:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That feeling you had\Nis extremely important.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.72,0:13:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to focus on\Nunveiling what it meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.46,0:13:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your time to shine at last, Pesci.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.28,0:13:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have faith in yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.48,0:13:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,dear brother of mine, and\Nbelieve in your amazing power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.68,0:13:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.98,0:13:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.24,0:13:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now think hard and tell me anything\Nthat comes to mind that might help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.06,0:13:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something in\Nparticular catch your eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Like some strange dark\Nobject, for instance. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.34,0:13:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A dark object?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.50,0:13:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember now, big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.24,0:13:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I was about to look under this\Nseat here, but I got distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.58,0:13:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure I saw something. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.16,0:13:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, wow, that's embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.04,0:14:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, Big Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.68,0:14:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew my intuition was crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.94,0:14:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I stop being useless?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.96,0:14:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I think you're on to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.18,0:14:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.09,0:14:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of you, Pesci.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.90,0:14:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You just solved our mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.06,0:14:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's now a light at the\Nend of this vexing tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.28,0:14:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.60,0:14:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What light did I find?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.78,0:14:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it curious that there'd be random\Nanimal feces under the seat of a train car?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.64,0:14:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This shit didn't come from a rat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.88,0:14:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing would be long dead as\Ntheir lives are shorter lived than.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.06,0:14:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Their stool whatever left this\Nexcrement only did so a few moments ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.70,0:14:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You starting to wonder\Nwhat all this means? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.92,0:14:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans aren't the only species\Ncapable of possessing a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.20,0:14:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Which leaves only one explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.42,0:14:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a unique animal\Nhiding in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.32,0:14:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mercy kill it. Thankful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.34,0:14:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.25,0:14:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.76,0:14:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, it's a freaking turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.70,0:15:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Concealing our prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.54,0:15:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish, I can see the others, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.04,0:15:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected, the boys are passing on\Nto the big nursing home in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.20,0:15:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you're ready for another\Ndose of my aging power.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.32,0:15:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thankful death!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.90,0:15:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a second, big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.56,0:15:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't they supposed to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.94,0:15:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,To have another guy with them, huh I think
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.34,0:15:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,one of their buddies\Npulled a Houdini on us
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.78,0:15:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,B-staff!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.16,0:15:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.20,0:15:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take the last hunk of ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.84,0:15:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll make you all better!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.30,0:16:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it happened because I'm always\Nexpecting things to go sideways.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.96,0:16:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe I have my own\Nguardian angel out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.62,0:16:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But storing ice in my hat was the best\Ndecision I ever made. Number five,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.12,0:16:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even want to think\Nabout where I'd be right now if
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.88,0:16:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,your razor-sharp instincts hadn't\Nturned back the hands of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.66,0:16:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your quick thinking totally\Nsaved my ass, little buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.78,0:16:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The way you stopped the momentum of all\Nthree of those bullets you should be proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.88,0:16:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Number five I have one\Nmore favor to ask of you
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.68,0:16:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,if you're about to say\None of us should go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.68,0:16:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Number six has already\Nbeen revived and is on
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.98,0:16:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,his way he's got the ice\Nfrom your pocket and he's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.04,0:16:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Gonna tell everyone about\Nthe two users who are
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.06,0:16:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,closing in on the turtles\Nso you ain't gotta worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't ask for anything more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.68,0:16:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You should save that ice for the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.46,0:16:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think that I'll\Nbe needing it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.82,0:16:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I figured out which one\Nof them's missing, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.26,0:17:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.46,0:17:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He's our missing goon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.34,0:17:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.96,0:17:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,All that matters is us\Nretrieving the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.30,0:17:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.21,0:17:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to work! Thankful death!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.46,0:17:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's attacking from above!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.42,0:17:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your instincts are impressive, and I have\Nto say you're pretty light on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.76,0:17:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The man dressed in black.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.22,0:17:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I off him, the others will recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.44,0:17:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it, Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You get rid of this Soul bastard,\Neveryone will be as good as new! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.78,0:17:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell is Mista stand here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.30,0:17:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I emptied my freakin' gun into\Nhis skull at Point Blake Range!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.78,0:17:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That should've been all she wrote for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So how could that thing\Nhave gotten ice in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.72,0:17:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, don't let it touch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.22,0:17:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Direct contact with the stand\Nwill make you age even faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.92,0:17:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.02,0:18:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.98,0:18:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He's too quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.84,0:18:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Eyes on the prize!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.68,0:18:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus on taking care of the\Nfools hiding in the turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.94,0:18:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you hurry up and do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.74,0:18:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Put these weevils out of commission!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.06,0:18:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit you caught me\Nby surprise, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.68,0:18:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that Miesta would go through\Nall that trouble to tip you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.90,0:18:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Knocking off foes and protecting the\Ngirl regardless of the human cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.66,0:18:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the mission the\Nboss gave you, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You failed your Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.60,0:18:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.22,0:18:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.70,0:19:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I will fulfill my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.34,0:19:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And save my Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.46,0:19:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If the only thing that's\Nstanding in my way is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.68,0:19:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, victory's already well in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.48,0:19:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.92,0:19:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's much faster than I was expecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.90,0:19:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.66,0:19:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, Zipper Man, I think it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The name suits it nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.82,0:19:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no question that you are\Nnaturally endowed with the gift of speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.14,0:19:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But the sad fact of the matter is,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.44,0:19:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,you still don't know the first\Nthing about using it, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.40,0:19:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's sort of obvious but\NI'm a little short of breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.88,0:19:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And from where I'm sitting the same\Ngoes for you that tends to happen
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.40,0:19:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you know when one uses their Stand at\Nfull bore really how foolish of you
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.74,0:19:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,clearly that hadn't entered your mind\Nwhen you Were ordering your zipper
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.58,0:20:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,man to attack me at its maximum speed\Nand due to your lapse in judgment?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.06,0:20:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and your rapid aging has resumed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.28,0:20:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone should have informed you of\Nthis, but the greater the horsepower,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.98,0:20:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,the hotter the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.40,0:20:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Us two are burning a\Nwhole lot of calories.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.18,0:20:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you seem to be a man\Nof moderate intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.98,0:20:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can take my meaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think is gonna happen\Nas your body heats up further?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.28,0:20:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.68,0:20:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Uchirati!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.44,0:20:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.35,0:20:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The ice isn't working anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.48,0:20:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's your next move, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The zipper you put on\Nme is starting to close.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.08,0:20:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon enough, I'll be right as rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.18,0:20:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.14,0:20:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There goes the one on my chin, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.16,0:20:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.48,0:20:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You feeling a bit stiff and tuckered out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.98,0:20:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And this, Zipper Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.52,0:20:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, you're so predictable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.40,0:20:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a dirt nap, Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.52,0:21:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I'm done, you and your friends\Nwill be off to the crematorium.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.90,0:21:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, we'll make sure\Nthe girl is well taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.84,0:21:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you stop talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.24,0:21:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew exactly what\Nwould happen to my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.92,0:21:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.83,0:21:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was also well aware\Nthat I could be captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.34,0:21:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But a mission must be completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll protect my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.64,0:21:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kapos worth their salt\Nmust be prepared for both.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.28,0:21:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the burden we all carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.82,0:21:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you say the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.72,0:21:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm raring to go. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.96,0:21:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.87,0:21:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.86,0:21:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.96,0:21:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.06,0:21:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of my goals are really quite doable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.64,0:21:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I get you off\Nthis speeding train, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.12,0:21:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Killing you will break the aging\Nspell, thereby reviving my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.92,0:21:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Trish isn't going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.46,0:21:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a damn fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.96,0:21:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to die, do it alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going over 150 an hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.46,0:21:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ironic, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.64,0:21:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who grabbed\Nme, if you'll recall.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.08,0:21:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.99,0:22:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to die like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.68,0:22:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Jacksonville!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.68,0:22:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.14,0:22:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Freaking you is all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.46,0:22:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your body.
